  "id": "intrapersonal",
  "term": "intrapersonal",
  "definition": "Intrapersonal refers to processes that happen within one person, especially internal communication such as self-talk or imagined interactions. In this kind of communication, the same individual contains both the sending and receiving sides and uses self-directed activity to shape and interpret experience.",
